  { rank: '2', suit: 'Spades' },
  { rank: '3', suit: 'Spades' },
  // ... more cards ...
  { rank: 'King', suit: 'Diamonds' }
];
const shuffledDeck = shuffleDeck(deck);
```
This will return a shuffled deck of cards in the same format as the input array.

