The function then loops through each laptop in the laptops list, and checks if the laptop's price is less than or equal to the customer's budget. If it is, it checks if the laptop matches the customer's preferred brand, processor, memory, and storage capacity (if specified). If the laptop matches all of the customer's preferences, it is added to the recommended laptops list.
